      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.95,
      "end_seconds": 280.65,
      "duration_seconds": 12.7,
      "text": "great, that's useful you need to go to the hospital now for an emergency scan the gynaecology team would be the right next step, I'll refer you"
    },
