      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.76,
      "end_seconds": 301.85,
      "duration_seconds": 15.09,
      "text": "keep an eye out, and if the pain gets worse or you faint, call us the same day or go to emergency. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
